1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 14]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,610
Master, Tu is dead.

4
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,450
You can take my Cui.

5
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,570
Cui?

6
00:04:14,310 --> 00:04:14,890
Cui.

7
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:21,850
♪The river in Guangling flows like an emerald ribbon♪

8
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:29,250
♪The royal fleet sways to common woes♪

9
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,460
♪Don't ask from whence I came♪

10
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,660
You're in a good mood today.

11
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,140
You're singing a Xiangxi song.

12
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,140
We live to see another day.

13
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,850
And so I must sing joyfully.

14
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:45,810
Master Zhang,

15
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,140
to be honest with you,

16
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,850
I thought we were done for.

17
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,700
I performed a divination before I left,

18
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,730
and I got death.

19
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,980
You can die now.

20
00:04:58,430 --> 00:05:00,290
Or people might say that your divination

21
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:01,170
never comes true.

22
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:03,580
They won't.

23
00:05:04,390 --> 00:05:07,020
Because we ran into a Qiongqi.

24
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,340
My ancestors told me

25
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:10,930
that any divination involving a person

26
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,900
with a Qiongqi tattoo would never be accurate.

27
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:15,580
So you risked your life to come here.

28
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:18,050
What did you find?

29
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,100
Tell me.

30
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,020
Master Zhang,

31
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,340
that's not what I meant.

32
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,370
I meant...

33
00:05:23,830 --> 00:05:24,490
Fine.

34
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:25,290
I'll tell you.

35
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,410
The ritual grass in the shrine

36
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,580
is in the style of Xiangxi.

37
00:05:28,950 --> 00:05:31,020
In Xiangxi, the ritual grass is used in cave rituals.

38
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,490
Only the one who receives enlightenment in the cave

39
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:34,460
can take the ritual grass with them to preach.

40
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,020
Not only does the Otherworld Patriarch

41
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,410
has a tower in Changsha,

42
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:38,900
but he also has a cave in Xiangxi.

43
00:05:39,830 --> 00:05:41,290
So Xiangxi it is, then.

44
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,660
Master Zhang,

45
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,370
I'm curious.

46
00:05:45,270 --> 00:05:46,810
How did you find me?

47
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,220
I didn't leave

48
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:50,290
any traces behind on my journey.

49
00:05:50,630 --> 00:05:51,980
Xiangu sent a messenger.

50
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:54,050
Master Zhang, can we speak?

51
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,660
Xiangu told me to come here.

52
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:01,140
She said Eighth Master was in grave danger,

53
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,980
and that you had to go to this place immediately.

54
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:10,050
Xiangu was so kind.

55
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:12,370
She sent Xiaomei to inform you.

56
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:16,290
That means she does like you.

57
00:06:16,750 --> 00:06:17,660
She might not show

58
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,610
the same kindness to anyone else.

59
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,250
But Master Zhang,

60
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:27,020
the Huo Clan is a bandwagoner.

61
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:30,100
They have been working with Ding Qiansui closely lately.

62
00:06:30,510 --> 00:06:31,850
They are waiting to see

63
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:34,140
who will win in the end.

64
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,290
The Mystic Nine, or Ding Qiansui.

65
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,700
Now that Xiangu has done me a favor,

66
00:06:39,510 --> 00:06:41,220
she'll have a hard time answering to her clan.

67
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:44,140
While her clan is working with Ding Qiansui,

68
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:47,580
Xiangu herself still sides with the Mystic Nine.

69
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:50,290
She helped you because she cares.

70
00:06:52,870 --> 00:06:54,250
The weather is great today.

71
00:06:55,070 --> 00:06:56,490
Indeed.

72
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,410
Sing.

73
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:00,850
Master Zhang.

74
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:02,660
I only know two lines.

75
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,410
Sure, I'll continue.

76
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:16,100
♪Administer the medicine and help the sick♪

77
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:22,500
[Huo's Residence]

78
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,050
Xiaomei!

79
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:42,730
Xiaomei!

80
00:07:43,310 --> 00:07:44,170
Put her down at once.

81
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,340
Why did you do that?

82
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,460
Because of you.

83
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:57,730
Why?

84
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:01,370
You told Zhang Qishan

85
00:08:01,510 --> 00:08:02,780
Qi Tiezui's whereabouts.

86
00:08:04,390 --> 00:08:05,780
She was punished on your behalf.

87
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,220
You don't know?

88
00:08:08,070 --> 00:08:10,980
You have achieved what you wanted to achieve.

89
00:08:11,950 --> 00:08:13,340
Isn't this

90
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,220
the outcome you seek?

91
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:16,490
Xiaomei knows nothing.

92
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:18,410
I merely gave her the order.

93
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,780
Just put her down.

94
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,490
At this point,

95
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:23,730
you should just worry about yourself.

96
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,410
No harming each other within the Mystic Nine.

97
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,460
I was just doing my job.

98
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,610
Foolish.

99
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,540
We nominated you as the head of the clan

100
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:33,820
because you are smart.

101
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,420
Do you really think

102
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,370
that you have the power to order us around?

103
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:47,220
Nian.

104
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,820
I once told you

105
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,820
that as long as you did Ding Qiansui's bidding,

106
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:55,490
anyone you cared about could become successful.

107
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,460
But you defied us.

108
00:08:58,630 --> 00:08:59,730
This outcome

109
00:09:01,030 --> 00:09:02,770
is the consequence of your action.

110
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:04,420
Do you know?

111
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,770
Ding Qiansui is already dead.

112
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,700
We have repaid our debt to him.

113
00:09:09,870 --> 00:09:11,700
His life or death has nothing to do with us anymore.

114
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,420
Can't you see the bigger picture?

115
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:14,770
We are pawns.

116
00:09:14,770 --> 00:09:15,580
We have a place to be.

117
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,160
Ding Qiansui became this powerful

118
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,940
because his mastermind wanted to use him

119
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,650
to eliminate the Mystic Nine.

120
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,340
Now that he's gone,

121
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:27,180
the mastermind wants to use us.

122
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,250
If we do their bidding,

123
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:32,340
we can easily become the head of Mystic Nine.

124
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:34,250
Ding Qiansui worked for the Japanese.

125
00:09:34,510 --> 00:09:36,370
Are you planning to work with the Japanese?

126
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:39,890
I see it now.

127
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:42,130
Have you

128
00:09:42,150 --> 00:09:43,610
already worked with the Japanese?

129
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,100
Don't you know

130
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,820
that they want to take over our nation?

131
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,610
And why does it matter to us?

132
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,820
Be it the Japanese or the Mystic Nine,

133
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,220
whoever can preserve our clan legacy

134
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:57,340
will be our friends.

135
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,730
Our legacy cannot fall.

136
00:10:00,910 --> 00:10:01,650
Otherwise,

137
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,700
women like us

138
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:07,460
will suffer a horrible fate.

139
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,460
Surely, you are aware of that.

140
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,530
Girls!

141
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:24,980
This is your confession letter.

142
00:10:24,980 --> 00:10:25,740
[Confession Letter]

143
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:27,340
Sign it

144
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:29,650
and receive your punishment.

145
00:10:30,150 --> 00:10:30,850
I don't care.

146
00:10:31,670 --> 00:10:32,890
We cannot work with the Japanese.

147
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,580
How delusional.

148
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,700
The moment we decided

149
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:39,820
to work with Ding Qiansui,

150
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,250
we already knew

151
00:10:42,630 --> 00:10:44,220
there was no turning back.

152
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,610
Just sign it.

153
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,460
Madam.

154
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:53,730
Please.

155
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:57,490
Touch me if you dare.

156
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:03,340
You're asking for it.

157
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,340
Hit her!

158
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:06,980
Xiaomei.

159
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:08,420
Xiaomei!

160
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:28,940
Impossible.

161
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,890
If Hatoyama could do that,

162
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,890
why didn't he kill all of us already?

163
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:35,730
If he could kill across time and space,

164
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,490
I would be dead first.

165
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,940
But he chose to kill Ding Qiansui.

166
00:11:41,870 --> 00:11:43,300
This doesn't make sense,

167
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,980
but they said

168
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,580
it wasn't a spell.

169
00:11:49,910 --> 00:11:52,610
Ding Qiansui said that Yoshiyuki Hatoyama had been to Xiangxi.

170
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:53,530
Master.

171
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:00,610
We have news from Third Master.

172
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:01,850
The underground river

173
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,010
follows this route.

174
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,060
It leads to Xiangxi.

175
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,180
But it branches out

176
00:12:05,390 --> 00:12:06,820
too much in Xiangxi. It's hard to judge where they went.

177
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,980
The discovery of the Otherworld Tower

178
00:12:09,150 --> 00:12:10,890
is enough to earn him merits in Japan,

179
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:11,940
but he's still not content.

180
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,420
Master Zhang,

181
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:16,730
perhaps Xiangxi hides a bigger secret?

182
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:18,730
Eighth Master.

183
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,460
Ding Qiansui said that this was the secret

184
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:24,180
behind

185
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:26,010
Hatoyama's spells.

186
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,730
Have you seen this before?

187
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:29,700
See what?

188
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:30,940
It's so ugly.

189
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:31,610
Master Zhang.

190
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,300
What nonsense is this?

191
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:34,490
Urgh.

192
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:36,200
It's a golden pot.

193
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,300
It rotates when used.

194
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:40,010
Let's go now.

195
00:12:40,390 --> 00:12:41,180
Ninth Master

196
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:43,330
will handle the origin of the pot.

197
00:12:43,390 --> 00:12:44,530
But Xiangxi is huge.

198
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:46,180
How are we supposed to find them?

199
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,980
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama probably went to Xiangxi

200
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:48,850
to find

201
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:50,530
the cave in which the Otherworld Patriarch received enlightenment.

202
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,300
Master Zhang,

203
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:53,940
if we can solicit

204
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,220
the support from 82 Stockade,

205
00:12:55,390 --> 00:12:56,490
we will definitely find the one

206
00:12:56,550 --> 00:12:58,100
who saw the Otherworld Patriarch back then

207
00:12:58,390 --> 00:12:59,940
and the location of the cave.

208
00:13:01,150 --> 00:13:02,130
We'll depart immediately

209
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,250
to Xiangxi.

210
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,130
We already have troops stationed over there.

211
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,770
Tell them to contact 82 Stockade

212
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,010
and explain why we're there.

213
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:09,010
Noted.

214
00:13:09,670 --> 00:13:10,420
But what should we say

215
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,180
if the Ministry of War inquires about our movement?

216
00:13:12,870 --> 00:13:13,460
If we leave now,

217
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:14,530
Huo Wenhai can take over

218
00:13:14,550 --> 00:13:15,530
Changsha.

219
00:13:16,870 --> 00:13:17,580
Tell everyone

220
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:18,580
that Zhang Qishan

221
00:13:18,910 --> 00:13:20,060
went to 82 Stockade to borrow soldiers

222
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,100
for Changsha's defense

223
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,580
and future battles.

224
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:23,850
It's a secret operation

225
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:24,730
and it won't be reported.

226
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:25,250
Yes.

227
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:29,650
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

228
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:31,250
is a renowned scientist in Japan.

229
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,490
He planned carefully

230
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,460
to take

231
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,850
Laogou away from Changsha.

232
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:39,530
It seems like Laogou plays an important role

233
00:13:40,030 --> 00:13:41,460
in the Japanese plan.

234
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,940
Fifth Master is a hooligan.

235
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,820
I don't see why the Japanese

236
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:47,610
think

237
00:13:47,630 --> 00:13:48,940
he is so valuable.

238
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:51,980
Save Laogou.

239
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,300
Will you come or not?

240
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:54,340
Yes.

241
00:13:55,270 --> 00:13:56,530
I have to be there.

242
00:13:59,630 --> 00:14:01,130
Xiangu saved me.

243
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,010
Don't move.

244
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:01,980
Don't move!

245
00:15:26,750 --> 00:15:27,300
Come out.

246
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:40,580
Mr. Wu,

247
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,220
speed up the progress now.

248
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,890
Zhang Qishan is trying his best to rescue you,

249
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,300
but it'll take him some time

250
00:15:50,030 --> 00:15:51,770
to find this place.

251
00:15:55,910 --> 00:15:57,770
Do you really expect him to save you?

252
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,850
So your falling out with him

253
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,730
was just a rumor then.

254
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:06,730
Guards.

255
00:16:10,790 --> 00:16:11,530
Can you guess who they are?

256
00:16:12,390 --> 00:16:14,460
Show us what you can do

257
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:18,250
or they will become its meal.

258
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,580
I was wondering

259
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:24,180
what a smart Japanese person like you

260
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,890
would do to torture me.

261
00:16:26,910 --> 00:16:27,580
Disappointingly,

262
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:31,220
it's still the same old dirty trick.

263
00:16:31,870 --> 00:16:35,130
Yes, the same old dirty trick

264
00:16:35,750 --> 00:16:39,610
which works so well against the Chinese.

265
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:43,220
People wouldn't be suffering if Zhang Qishan

266
00:16:44,270 --> 00:16:46,220
actually cared to save everyone.

267
00:17:30,030 --> 00:17:30,570
Stop.

268
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:37,730
I'll tame it.

269
00:17:38,070 --> 00:17:38,660
How long do you need?

270
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,460
Seven days.

271
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,290
Five days.

272
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,380
It takes time to tame it!

273
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:42,660
You have five days.

274
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:52,770
Fine. Five days.

275
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:54,010
Let them out now.

276
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,290
Now!

277
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:12,010
After five days,

278
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:14,460
I want to see the result.

279
00:18:16,510 --> 00:18:17,140
Wait.

280
00:18:22,510 --> 00:18:23,980
Then, I have to use my secret weapon.

281
00:18:26,070 --> 00:18:28,770
Whatever you have in there is useless.

282
00:18:29,110 --> 00:18:30,010
What do you need?

283
00:18:30,750 --> 00:18:31,810
Taming a dog

284
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,980
is all about one thing.

285
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:37,180
Find their favourite food.

286
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,530
Even a wolf

287
00:18:39,070 --> 00:18:40,460
will wag its tail when it smells

288
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,490
its favourite food.

289
00:18:43,310 --> 00:18:43,770
Therefore,

290
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:46,330
find out what this beast

291
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,700
loves to eat.

292
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:48,570
What kind of food?

293
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:50,620
How would I know?

294
00:18:52,310 --> 00:18:53,010
So,

295
00:18:53,790 --> 00:18:56,290
go to the place where you captured it.

296
00:18:56,830 --> 00:18:58,290
There might be a lot of leads there.

297
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:01,050
For example, hair, paw prints,

298
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,700
or even leftover bones.

299
00:19:03,510 --> 00:19:04,730
Those will help me understand its instinct.

300
00:19:07,510 --> 00:19:08,330
To tame it,

301
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:11,050
you start with its instinct.

302
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,570
Mr. Wu, you're trying to escape.

303
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:19,220
You think I can escape?

304
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:22,770
Bring him with us.

305
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:23,730
Yes!

306
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:25,460
What else do you need?

307
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:27,570
I need a whistle.

308
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:29,290
Give me a paper and a pen.

309
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:31,530
Give him what he wants.

310
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:43,940
[Otherworld Patriarch]

311
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:52,490
My child,

312
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:55,220
you are stubborn.

313
00:19:58,680 --> 00:19:59,490
Come.

314
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,770
Let me show you your previous life.

315
00:20:16,310 --> 00:20:17,220
I'll say it one more time.

316
00:20:17,220 --> 00:20:17,880
[Silky Masterpiece]

317
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,490
I'm not part of the Wang Clan anymore.

318
00:20:20,030 --> 00:20:22,660
I decide who I want to marry.

319
00:20:23,070 --> 00:20:25,050
I joined this embroidery workshop because I wanted

320
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,330
nothing to do with hooligans like you.

321
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:28,050
Are you pushing your luck?

322
00:20:29,350 --> 00:20:30,140
What are you doing?

323
00:20:30,140 --> 00:20:30,860
- Hey! - Don't come near us.

324
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:32,290
You're in public now.

325
00:20:32,510 --> 00:20:34,290
You can't hit us.

326
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,490
What is the meaning of this?

327
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:38,010
Is this how your clan does this?

328
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,770
Whoever marries you

329
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:41,530
will be miserable forever.

330
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:42,860
This is none of your business.

331
00:20:43,030 --> 00:20:43,700
Move aside.

332
00:20:44,070 --> 00:20:44,570
Hey!

333
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:45,290
- Madam! - Let me teach you a lesson.

334
00:20:45,310 --> 00:20:46,140
[Lin Lanqing]
- Hey! - Stop.

335
00:20:47,110 --> 00:20:47,620
Madam.

336
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:49,900
The Madam is here.

337
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,730
Madam, help me out.

338
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:58,460
Blacksmith Wang.

339
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,010
Instead of minding your business,

340
00:21:01,550 --> 00:21:03,490
you came to bully the women of this workshop?

341
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:04,570
Lin Lanqing.

342
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:07,940
You're just a stupid spinster.

343
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:10,860
And now, you're housing a bunch of sleazy women

344
00:21:11,110 --> 00:21:12,180
in your stupid embroidery workshop.

345
00:21:12,350 --> 00:21:13,960
The whole Jiangning looks filthy

346
00:21:14,070 --> 00:21:15,050
because of you.

347
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:17,770
Stupid embroidery workshop?

348
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:21,380
[Jiangning Women's Embroidery Workshop]
This plaque was given personally

349
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:22,980
by the Imperial Household Department.

350
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:26,460
Other than the Jiangning Weaving Bureau, no one has it.

351
00:21:26,460 --> 00:21:27,380
[Jiangning Women's Embroidery Workshop]

352
00:21:27,830 --> 00:21:29,420
I don't even have to report you

353
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,860
to the magistrate's office.

354
00:21:31,270 --> 00:21:33,010
I can just report you to the Imperial Household Department.

355
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:35,140
Can you bear the consequences?

356
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:39,530
Madam, you are amazing.

357
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:41,380
When we go out,

358
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:43,530
everyone in Jiangning looks at us with respect.

359
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:45,530
That's right. That will show them what will happen to those

360
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:47,530
who cross us.

361
00:21:47,750 --> 00:21:48,660
Yes.

362
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:50,490
Xiaoshu.

363
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:52,290
Today is an exception.

364
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:53,660
From now on,

365
00:21:54,790 --> 00:21:56,220
do not quarrel with them.

366
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:59,940
I didn't do it. They started...

367
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:02,900
Lanqing.

368
00:22:08,750 --> 00:22:09,570
Mr. Magistrate.

369
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:10,770
At ease.

370
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:14,900
You're dismissed.

371
00:22:15,640 --> 00:22:16,570
Mr. Magistrate.

372
00:22:16,750 --> 00:22:18,490
How can I help you?

373
00:22:18,830 --> 00:22:20,730
The higher-up

374
00:22:21,110 --> 00:22:22,940
placed an emergency order.

375
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,090
500 bolts per month,

376
00:22:31,510 --> 00:22:32,570
for a total amount of 3,000 bolts.

377
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:33,420
I...

378
00:22:34,590 --> 00:22:36,810
That's nearly 30% of the Weaving Bureau's annual output.

379
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:41,490
You're not the only one who received the order.

380
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:43,900
From Hangzhou all the way to Suzhou,

381
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:47,380
every workshop has to produce hundreds of bolts now.

382
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:48,380
Mr. Magistrate,

383
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:51,570
our workshop only has around 100 people, and we sew by hand.

384
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:54,140
We won't reach this number even if we sew till we die.

385
00:22:54,750 --> 00:22:56,050
The higher you are, the greater you fall.

386
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:58,330
Are you trying to defy the imperial decree?

387
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:00,530
You'll lose your reputation,

388
00:23:00,790 --> 00:23:01,810
your plaque,

389
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,860
and even your family members.

390
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,620
What are you doing?

391
00:23:24,790 --> 00:23:25,980
What are you doing?

392
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:26,660
Am I getting killed?

393
00:23:27,320 --> 00:23:28,220
Be nice.

394
00:23:28,350 --> 00:23:29,420
Let go of me!

395
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,250
Let go!

396
00:23:36,750 --> 00:23:38,940
Madam, we didn't mean to run away.

397
00:23:39,110 --> 00:23:39,940
That's right, Madam.

398
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:42,290
Our fingers are cut.

399
00:23:43,070 --> 00:23:44,290
Our eyes are blurry.

400
00:23:45,030 --> 00:23:47,380
We are just a burden to the workshop.

401
00:23:48,270 --> 00:23:50,330
Please spare us.

402
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:52,050
If all of you run away,

403
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,620
the rest

404
00:23:55,960 --> 00:23:56,860
will die.

405
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:58,860
But if we continue working like this,

406
00:23:59,070 --> 00:24:01,330
we'll die from exhaustion too, Madam.

407
00:24:02,790 --> 00:24:04,920
Please spare us.

408
00:24:04,950 --> 00:24:06,770
- Madam. - Madam.

409
00:24:06,790 --> 00:24:08,010
- Madam. - Madam.

410
00:24:08,030 --> 00:24:09,160
Mercy.

411
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:09,810
Madam.

412
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:11,410
Madam.

413
00:24:11,930 --> 00:24:12,730
Madam.

414
00:24:13,070 --> 00:24:14,940
I beg you, Madam.

415
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:16,770
Take them away.

416
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,530
Don't do this, Madam.

417
00:24:19,550 --> 00:24:21,220
- Madam. - Madam.

418
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:22,250
- Madam. - Madam.

419
00:24:22,270 --> 00:24:24,070
Madam!

420
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:26,490
Don't do this.

421
00:24:31,550 --> 00:24:32,180
Madam.

422
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:35,810
You said women in this workshop should not hurt each other.

423
00:24:36,790 --> 00:24:38,090
Why did you break the promise?

424
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:49,860
I

425
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:53,140
had no choice.

426
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:02,460
You earned this plaque

427
00:25:03,590 --> 00:25:06,330
with your needle and thread.

428
00:25:07,350 --> 00:25:08,660
In the past, we enjoyed the glory and the fame.

429
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:12,940
You said it'd protect us.

430
00:25:16,200 --> 00:25:19,140
But I don't see any protection now,

431
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:21,330
only suffering.

432
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,460
Women like us

433
00:25:30,310 --> 00:25:31,980
fight an uphill battle

434
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:35,620
to survive in this world.

435
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:40,180
In this workshop, we can feel safe.

436
00:25:41,720 --> 00:25:42,700
We won't be bullied.

437
00:25:46,310 --> 00:25:48,380
And we owe it to our needlework.

438
00:25:50,720 --> 00:25:51,770
If the workshop falls,

439
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:54,090
and the plaque is gone,

440
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:58,010
we will be forced

441
00:25:58,310 --> 00:26:00,290
to marry men

442
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:03,050
or sold as slaves.

443
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:05,940
What we can do now

444
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:09,140
is to embroider obediently

445
00:26:10,240 --> 00:26:11,530
to keep our workshop alive.

446
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,290
There is no other way.

447
00:26:19,950 --> 00:26:21,200
To be enslaved by others

448
00:26:22,110 --> 00:26:23,420
or to be enslaved here,

449
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:25,980
what difference does it make?

450
00:27:06,780 --> 00:27:09,940
[Huo Clan Salt Mine]

451
00:27:23,550 --> 00:27:24,180
Xiaomei.

452
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:37,290
Xiaomei.

453
00:27:41,510 --> 00:27:42,330
Miss Huo.

454
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:51,460
Miss Huo.

455
00:27:52,550 --> 00:27:55,980
Have I carried out the task you gave me?

456
00:27:59,270 --> 00:28:00,530
Yes, you did so well.

457
00:28:07,110 --> 00:28:07,770
Don't worry.

458
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:10,530
I'll bring you out.

459
00:28:13,310 --> 00:28:14,010
You're awake?

460
00:28:18,350 --> 00:28:19,250
Is this the salt mine?

461
00:28:21,110 --> 00:28:22,050
You can't tell?

462
00:28:23,070 --> 00:28:24,050
Huo Clan salt mine.

463
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:29,810
If you're awake, start working now.

464
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:36,380
She's seriously injured.

465
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:38,770
Can you find a doctor to treat her?

466
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,050
Are you bossing me around?

467
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:43,290
Do you think you're still the head of the clan?

468
00:28:44,240 --> 00:28:45,220
You want a doctor?

469
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:46,490
Listen.

470
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:48,770
Your confession letter is still here in the mine.

471
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:51,180
You have been disowned by the Huo Clan.

472
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:52,770
You're as good as dead.

473
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:55,900
This is your afterlife.

474
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:59,980
From now on, you'll listen to us.

475
00:29:05,830 --> 00:29:06,770
Play nice.

476
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:22,050
Don't move. Or I'll cut her.

477
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,330
- Hurry up. - Be quick.

478
00:30:01,350 --> 00:30:01,620
Quick.

479
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,220
- Work now. - Don't be lazy.

480
00:30:05,070 --> 00:30:05,700
Work fast.

481
00:30:08,110 --> 00:30:09,330
Let's go.

482
00:30:20,400 --> 00:30:21,140
Lock the gate.

483
00:30:22,270 --> 00:30:24,380
There are only black plague patients inside. She'll die soon.

484
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:02,490
Xiaomei.

485
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:32,810
Xiaomei.

486
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:35,290
Xiaomei.

487
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:36,730
Xiaomei.

488
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:38,010
Xiaomei!

489
00:31:41,160 --> 00:31:41,730
Xiaomei.

490
00:35:04,930 --> 00:35:06,120
Look. It's so beautiful.

491
00:35:07,430 --> 00:35:08,400
So pretty.

492
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:16,490
Xiaozhu obeys the dog whistle.

493
00:35:17,440 --> 00:35:18,860
It can command every dog in my clan.

494
00:35:22,550 --> 00:35:23,860
It will hide by your side every day,

495
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:25,980
and will appear when you need it.

496
00:36:03,300 --> 00:36:05,500
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Great Matron]

497
00:36:05,500 --> 00:36:07,700
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Founding Matron]

498
00:36:12,230 --> 00:36:12,900
My sisters,

499
00:36:13,710 --> 00:36:15,940
we have to appoint a new head today.

500
00:36:16,800 --> 00:36:17,820
Take a good look.

501
00:36:19,030 --> 00:36:21,780
Pick an obedient girl.

502
00:36:58,960 --> 00:36:59,610
All of you, leave now.

503
00:37:09,510 --> 00:37:10,130
Xiaomei.

504
00:37:13,590 --> 00:37:14,690
I brought you back.

505
00:37:16,230 --> 00:37:17,460
How did you get out?

506
00:37:18,920 --> 00:37:19,570
Guards!

507
00:37:25,670 --> 00:37:26,460
Touch me if you dare.

508
00:37:32,190 --> 00:37:34,170
Everyone in the salt mine is dead.

509
00:37:39,110 --> 00:37:40,980
If you want to join them,

510
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,210
feel free.

511
00:38:02,510 --> 00:38:04,380
And my three honorable aunts,

512
00:38:05,480 --> 00:38:06,740
any tricks you have left?

513
00:38:13,920 --> 00:38:15,260
I'm waiting.

514
00:38:21,190 --> 00:38:23,610
May I know what the important occasion is?

515
00:38:24,670 --> 00:38:26,130
I see the elders of the Huo Sisters Guild

516
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:28,780
have gathered here with everyone else.

517
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:31,050
Today,

518
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:34,780
we will appoint a new head of the clan

519
00:38:35,760 --> 00:38:37,420
because the previous head

520
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:39,860
is dead.

521
00:38:42,590 --> 00:38:44,050
Is this a joke, my aunt?

522
00:38:46,670 --> 00:38:48,050
Aren't I alive?

523
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:50,260
When I say you're dead,

524
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:53,460
you are dead.

525
00:38:55,670 --> 00:38:56,380
Bring them out.

526
00:39:06,320 --> 00:39:07,130
They are

527
00:39:07,150 --> 00:39:08,940
your loyal sisters.

528
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:13,260
They have been helping you.

529
00:39:14,400 --> 00:39:15,900
They even got on their knees to beg me

530
00:39:16,760 --> 00:39:18,010
when I sent you to the salt mine.

531
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:19,900
They asked me to spare you.

532
00:39:20,920 --> 00:39:21,940
Surely, you don't want

533
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:23,260
to see them dead here.

534
00:39:24,190 --> 00:39:26,170
And where is your mother's memorial tablet?

535
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:30,050
Don't you want to find out?

536
00:39:31,590 --> 00:39:33,740
So you have been plotting against me

537
00:39:34,880 --> 00:39:36,170
the moment I became the head of the clan.

538
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:42,130
The kindness you showed when I was little

539
00:39:44,360 --> 00:39:45,570
was all fake.

540
00:39:54,030 --> 00:39:55,740
Our ancestral teaching is right.

541
00:39:58,630 --> 00:39:59,940
Never trust anyone.

542
00:40:01,280 --> 00:40:02,610
Never fall in love.

543
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:04,490
Nian,

544
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:08,780
you have finally

545
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:11,530
understood this.

546
00:40:12,630 --> 00:40:14,420
But you have to make a choice now.

547
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:18,610
Save them

548
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:20,980
or save yourself.

549
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:36,610
What fictitious crime do you want me to carry this time?

550
00:40:37,880 --> 00:40:38,610
Anything.

551
00:40:40,920 --> 00:40:43,010
Maybe you're brokenhearted because your lover, Wu Laogou,

552
00:40:43,590 --> 00:40:44,900
is dead,

553
00:40:45,920 --> 00:40:47,260
so you want to follow his footsteps.

554
00:40:59,190 --> 00:40:59,900
Nian.

555
00:41:02,710 --> 00:41:03,490
Drink it.

556
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:06,260
Drink it.

557
00:41:07,030 --> 00:41:09,820
Your mother's memorial tablet will be kept safely,

558
00:41:10,510 --> 00:41:12,130
and your loyal sisters can live.

559
00:41:16,230 --> 00:41:17,010
No!

560
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:18,780
No!

561
00:41:19,360 --> 00:41:20,300
No!

562
00:41:21,460 --> 00:41:22,300
No!

563
00:41:26,150 --> 00:41:27,090
Time is running out.

564
00:41:28,190 --> 00:41:29,380
We are old now.

565
00:41:30,510 --> 00:41:33,490
Make your decision now.

566
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:03,570
- No! - No!

567
00:43:01,030 --> 00:43:03,210
Xiangu, I love you the most here.

568
00:43:21,630 --> 00:43:23,860
Two days ago, I saw them burning letters in the backyard.

569
00:43:26,710 --> 00:43:28,260
One of them concerns your mother.

570
00:43:28,680 --> 00:43:29,910
[Yuhua has fallen in Northwest China]
And I hid it.

571
00:43:30,190 --> 00:43:31,570
Then, they captured us.

572
00:43:32,880 --> 00:43:33,650
From now on,

573
00:43:34,360 --> 00:43:35,900
you are the head of the clan.

574
00:43:36,590 --> 00:43:38,740
Following our ancestral rules,

575
00:43:39,710 --> 00:43:42,490
your mother has to leave the clan.

576
00:43:44,550 --> 00:43:45,610
For you, your mother

577
00:43:46,280 --> 00:43:47,900
went to Northwestern China alone.

578
00:43:48,670 --> 00:43:51,530
It's a harsh place with no means of communication.

579
00:43:53,150 --> 00:43:54,420
So, she told me to tell you

580
00:43:55,000 --> 00:43:56,050
that from now on,

581
00:43:56,880 --> 00:43:59,260
prioritize our clan legacy over your own life.

582
00:43:59,590 --> 00:44:00,940
Manage our clan well.

583
00:44:07,960 --> 00:44:08,530
Nian.

584
00:44:13,400 --> 00:44:14,010
Aunt.

585
00:44:15,510 --> 00:44:16,420
My mother is...

586
00:44:17,800 --> 00:44:18,530
Your mother

587
00:44:19,920 --> 00:44:20,860
was killed

588
00:44:21,480 --> 00:44:22,840
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Yuhua]
by the vagrants in Northwestern China.

589
00:44:24,400 --> 00:44:25,260
So you asked

590
00:44:27,590 --> 00:44:30,170
Ding Qiansui to kill my mother.

591
00:44:31,320 --> 00:44:32,720
- No. - That's not true.

592
00:44:32,760 --> 00:44:34,340
I've always been the kindest to you.

593
00:44:34,400 --> 00:44:35,040
It was her.

594
00:44:35,590 --> 00:44:36,420
It was her.

595
00:44:36,880 --> 00:44:38,460
It was her. It has nothing to do with me.

596
00:44:38,510 --> 00:44:39,460
She did it.

597
00:44:39,480 --> 00:44:40,520
We didn't do it.

598
00:44:40,590 --> 00:44:41,740
It wasn't us.

599
00:45:00,710 --> 00:45:01,490
First Aunt.

600
00:45:03,150 --> 00:45:04,300
From now on,

601
00:45:06,280 --> 00:45:07,420
I'll take over the Huo Clan.

602
00:45:09,230 --> 00:45:10,920
I'll remove our old scars

603
00:45:10,920 --> 00:45:12,820
one by one.

604
00:45:13,710 --> 00:45:14,900
I'll find another way

605
00:45:15,670 --> 00:45:16,570
to keep this clan alive.

606
00:45:29,510 --> 00:45:31,210
But this future

607
00:45:34,360 --> 00:45:35,530
is not for you to see.

608
00:45:53,620 --> 00:45:57,780
♪The past fades like smoke♪

609
00:45:58,140 --> 00:46:00,860
♪A choice is made in silence♪

610
00:46:01,140 --> 00:46:03,940
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

611
00:46:04,340 --> 00:46:08,100
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

612
00:46:08,340 --> 00:46:11,780
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

613
00:46:12,060 --> 00:46:15,460
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

614
00:46:15,540 --> 00:46:22,820
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

615
00:46:23,260 --> 00:46:26,540
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

616
00:46:26,820 --> 00:46:30,060
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

617
00:46:30,220 --> 00:46:34,260
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

618
00:46:34,460 --> 00:46:37,820
♪Who believes in fate?♪

619
00:46:38,060 --> 00:46:41,420
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

620
00:46:41,660 --> 00:46:44,940
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

621
00:46:45,260 --> 00:46:48,940
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

622
00:46:49,140 --> 00:46:52,380
♪Take care♪

623
00:46:52,380 --> 00:46:54,940
♪We once raced♪

624
00:46:55,020 --> 00:46:56,940
♪For the dawn♪

625
00:46:57,100 --> 00:47:00,380
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

626
00:47:00,500 --> 00:47:03,780
♪In the web of fate♪

627
00:47:03,780 --> 00:47:06,980
♪No one can escape♪

628
00:47:07,980 --> 00:47:09,820
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

629
00:47:09,980 --> 00:47:11,540
♪We too were young once♪

630
00:47:11,620 --> 00:47:15,060
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

631
